  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/12/IMG_4182.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Los Makis han inundado con su flamenquito de alegr&iacute;a, la madrugada de este s&aacute;bado a domingo, la sala 2 de la nueva discoteca GROW Club Events, en la plaza Siglo XXI de Onda. Mientras, en la sala 1 sonaban las sesiones de los djs Fran Ib&aacute;&ntilde;ez, Rub&eacute;n Romera y Vicent Vidal Garc&iacute;a, que para Nochebuena ofrecer&aacute;n una gran fiesta Remember.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertolosmakisgrow211213/img_4146.jpg\" alt=\"img_4146\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertolosmakisgrow211213/img_4147.jpg\" alt=\"img_4147\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertolosmakisgrow211213/img_4148.jpg\" alt=\"img_4148\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertolosmakisgrow211213/img_4149.jpg\" alt=\"img_4149\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertolosmakisgrow211213/img_4150.jpg\" alt=\"img_4150\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertolosmakisgrow211213/img_4151.jpg\" alt=\"img_4151\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertolosmakisgrow211213/img_4154.jpg\" alt=\"img_4154\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertolosmakisgrow211213/img_4155.jpg\" alt=\"img_4155\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conc